  "description": "Behringer JN-80 8-voice analog polyphonic synthesizer: every controller of its manual's MIDI table, with the values it prints.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "JN-80 Manual",
      "notes": "MIDI controller table (pages 13, 14) read by tools/profiles/behringer/read-behringer-cc.mjs from Manual_BE_0722-AAP_JN-80.pdf (sha256 4b7fbfb2aaba5f1f3d525b54eca6efc5214614acf0226dbd0032414537f349d3), https://cdn-media.empowertribe.com/62429b907e491313443cdbe56fbae7f5/Manual_BE_0722-AAP_JN-80.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/behringer/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/behringer/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the guide's MIDI controller table, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Ranges are as printed (`0 - 99`): the guide does not say whether a range is the controller's values or what the panel shows for them.",
    "Left out, controllers that only have their MIDI standard meaning here: CC 0 Bank Select, CC 1 MOD Wheel, CC 2 Breath Controller, CC 3 Undefined, CC 4 Foot Pedal, CC 5 Portamento Time, CC 6 NRPN Data MSB, CC 7 Volume, CC 11 Expression, CC 36 LSB Controller for 0-31, CC 38 NRPN Data LSB, CC 64 Damper Pedal On/Off, CC 65 Portamento On/Off, CC 66 Sostenuto Pedal On/Off, CC 67 Soft Pedal On/Off, CC 68 Legato Footswitch, CC 69 Hold 2, CC 70 Sound Controller 1, CC 71 Sound Controller 2, CC 72 Sound Controller 3, CC 73 Sound Controller 4, CC 74 Sound Controller 5, CC 75 Sound Controller 6, CC 76 Sound Controller 7, CC 77 Sound Controller 8, CC 78 Sound Controller 9, CC 79 Sound Controller 10, CC 80 General Purpose MIDI CC Controller, CC 81 General Purpose MIDI CC Controller, CC 82 General Purpose MIDI CC Controller, CC 83 General Purpose MIDI CC Controller, CC 84 Portamento CC Control, CC 88 High Resolution Velocity Prefix, CC 96 NRPN Data increment, CC 97 NRPN Data decrement, CC 98 NRPN Param LSB, CC 99 NRPN Param MSB, CC 100 RPN Param LSB, CC 101 RPN Param MSB, CC 102 Undefined, CC 103 Undefined, CC 104 Undefined, CC 105 Undefined, CC 106 Undefined, CC 107 Undefined, CC 108 Undefined, CC 109 Undefined, CC 110 Undefined, CC 111 Undefined, CC 112 Undefined, CC 113 Undefined, CC 114 Undefined, CC 115 Undefined, CC 116 Undefined, CC 117 Undefined, CC 118 Undefined, CC 119 Undefined, CC 120 All sounds off, CC 121 Reset All Controllers, CC 122 Local on/off Switch, CC 123 All notes off, CC 124 Omni Mode Off, CC 125 Omni Mode On, CC 126 Mono Mode, CC 127 Poly Mode."
  ],
